([1]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: National Scholarship Portal schemes) Tj T*
(ID: nsp-scholarships) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://scholarships.gov.in/Students) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: National Scholarship Portal, Academic Year 2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  A Government of India portal listing central and state scholarship schemes for) Tj T*
(  eligible students.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Students; eligibility depends on the individual scholarship, academic year, domicile,) Tj T*
(  course and other scheme rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Requirements differ by scholarship. Use the official eligibility checker and read) Tj T*
(  the scheme guidelines for the current academic year.', 'The portal states that One) Tj T*
(  Time Registration is required to apply.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Scholarship benefits and amounts vary by scheme; consult the official scheme) Tj T*
(specifications for current terms.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ["Use the official portal's eligibility checker, select a current scholarship and) Tj T*
(  follow its application instructions."]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([2]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: PM-USP Central Sector Scheme of Scholarship for College and University Students \(CSSS\)) Tj T*
(ID: pm-usp-csss) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.education.gov.in/sites/upload_files/mhrd/files/upload_document/PM_USP_CSSS_guidelines_updated.pdf) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Education, PM-USP CSSS guidelines and National Scholarship Portal) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Merit-cum-means scholarship assistance for eligible students pursuing regular higher) Tj T*
(  education.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Meritorious students from families meeting the scheme's income and other conditions,) Tj T*
(  pursuing eligible regular college or university courses.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
