(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Fresh applicants must meet the applicable board merit/percentile criteria, pursue a) Tj T*
(  regular course, satisfy the current family-income ceiling, and not receive another) Tj T*
(  scholarship or fee reimbursement.', 'Course, renewal, board and annual application) Tj T*
(  rules are set in the current guidelines.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Annual scholarship assistance is  12,000 for the first three years of eligible) Tj T*
(undergraduate study and  20,000 for eligible later years/courses under the published) Tj T*
(guidelines; course-specific rules apply.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Apply for fresh or renewal scholarship through the National Scholarship Portal) Tj T*
(  during the application period announced for that academic year.', 'Follow the current) Tj T*
(  PM-USP guidelines and institute/state verification steps.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
