([3]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: National Means-cum-Merit Scholarship Scheme \(NMMSS\)) Tj T*
(ID: nmmss) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.education.gov.in/en/national-means-cum-merit-scholarship-scheme-nmmss) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Education NMMSS page and National Scholarship Portal 2026-27 scheme listing) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Scholarship support intended to help meritorious students from lower-income families) Tj T*
(  continue secondary education.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Selected students from eligible government, government-aided and local-body schools,) Tj T*
(  with continuation subject to renewal conditions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Selection is conducted by States/UTs at the prescribed school stage; students must) Tj T*
(  meet the current income, school, examination and marks criteria.', 'School types,) Tj T*
(  state selection procedures and renewal conditions are specified in current scheme) Tj T*
(  guidelines.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - The scheme rate published by the Ministry is  12,000 per year for selected) Tj T*
(students, subject to selection and renewal rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Take the State/UT selection examination when announced, then complete the required) Tj T*
(  application/renewal on the National Scholarship Portal.', 'Dates and state-level) Tj T*
(  instructions vary by academic year and State/UT.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
