(ID: pm-yasasvi) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://socialjustice.gov.in/schemes/101) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment, PM-YASASVI scheme page) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Umbrella scholarship and hostel-support scheme for eligible OBC, EBC and DNT) Tj T*
(  students.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Students in the scheme's OBC, EBC and DNT groups, across its pre-matric, post-matric) Tj T*
(  and top-class education sub-schemes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Eligibility depends on the selected sub-scheme, class/course, institution,) Tj T*
(  category, income and academic-year rules.', 'Use the current official sub-scheme) Tj T*
(  guidelines; the umbrella scheme does not have one shared eligibility test.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Scholarship or hostel support under the applicable sub-scheme. Benefit amounts,) Tj T*
(class/course coverage and slots vary by component and academic year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ["Check the current PM-YASASVI sub-scheme on the Ministry/NSP portal and apply using) Tj T*
(  that component's instructions and dates."]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
