(SCHEME: National Overseas Scholarship \(NOS\) for SC and other notified candidates) Tj T*
(ID: national-overseas-scholarship) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://socialjustice.gov.in/schemes/28) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment, NOS scheme page and 2026-27 guidelines) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Financial assistance for eligible low-income students to pursue a master's degree or) Tj T*
(  PhD abroad.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Eligible candidates from the categories listed in the current guidelines, including) Tj T*
(  Scheduled Castes, De-notified/Nomadic/Semi-Nomadic Tribes, landless agricultural) Tj T*
(  labourers and traditional artisans.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Applicants must meet the category, income, academic admission and other conditions) Tj T*
(  in the applicable selection-year guidelines.', 'Annual slots and category allocations) Tj T*
(  are limited and may change by selection year.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Financial assistance for approved overseas higher-education costs, including) Tj T*
(tuition and maintenance/other allowances under the current guidelines. Specific) Tj T*
