(SCHEME: Pre-Matric Scholarship Scheme for Scheduled Castes and Others) Tj T*
(ID: pre-matric-sc-scholarship) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://socialjustice.gov.in/schemes/23) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment, Pre-Matric Scholarship Scheme page) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Pre-matric education support through components for SC students and children of) Tj T*
(  people in specified hazardous occupations.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Eligible Indian students in the classes covered by the relevant component, studying) Tj T*
(  in India and domiciled in the implementing State/UT.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The SC component covers full-time Class IX-X students with parental/guardian income) Tj T*
(  within the notified ceiling.', 'A separate component covers Classes I-X for children) Tj T*
(  of parents/guardians in specified unclean or hazardous occupations; income and other) Tj T*
(  rules differ by component.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Academic allowance varies by component and day-scholar/hosteller status under) Tj T*
(current guidelines; additional disability allowances may apply.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Register through the National Scholarship Portal when applications open, then) Tj T*
(  complete any State/UT portal steps and verification.', 'The scheme is implemented by) Tj T*
(  States/UTs, so dates and additional procedures may vary.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
