(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Girl students admitted to an eligible technical programme at an AICTE-approved) Tj T*
(  institution; up to two girl children from a family may be eligible, subject to scheme) Tj T*
(  rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The applicant must be a girl student admitted to the first year of an AICTE-) Tj T*
(  approved technical degree or to the second year through lateral entry.', 'A maximum) Tj T*
(  of two girl children per family may be eligible.', 'Family income from all sources) Tj T*
(  must not exceed  8 lakh per annum during the applicable financial year; a State/UT-) Tj T*
(  issued income certificate is required.', 'Selection is merit-based. Current) Tj T*
(  admission-year, course and verification rules are set in the active academic-year) Tj T*
(  guidelines; check the official portal before applying.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - AICTE scheme guidelines state  50,000 per annum for each year of study as a lump-) Tj T*
(sum scholarship toward eligible education-related expenses. The maximum duration) Tj T*
(stated in the scheme guidelines is 4 years for first-year entrants and 3 years for) Tj T*
(second-year lateral-entry students; confirm current terms in the active academic-year) Tj T*
(guidelines.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Apply online through the National Scholarship Portal after completing its One Time) Tj T*
(  Registration. Select the matching AICTE Pragati Degree or Diploma scheme, submit the) Tj T*
(  application and required supporting documents, and follow institute and State/UT) Tj T*
(  verification steps shown on the portal.', 'Application windows, document requirements) Tj T*
(  and verification dates vary by academic year; consult the current NSP listing and) Tj T*
(  scheme guidelines.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
